/*
Title: PhantomJack Malicious Infrastructure Detection (DNS + URL)
ID: S1-PHANTOMJACK-005
Author: Brandon Lawrence
Date: 2026-02-25
Updated: 2026-09-22
Severity: High
Confidence: Medium

Description:
Detects contact with PhantomJack and PseudoTDS infrastructure across both DNS
resolution and browser URL telemetry.

Threat Behavior:
PhantomJack communicates with malicious domains used for payload delivery and
tracking. The redirect chain runs typosquat -> TDS -> DGA landing -> MSIX download.

Detection Logic:
DNS arm triggers on resolution of known campaign domains. URL arm triggers on the
campaign's stage-1 and stage-2 redirect path patterns (/jr.php?gz= and
/xfc/sfclick?u=) and on bare-domain matches.

Changelog 2026-09-22:
- Added the url.address arm. The rule was previously event.type = "DNS" only.
  Chrome resolves over DNS-over-HTTPS, so the entire 127-event delivery storyline
  on HERRINL-W11 produced exactly two DNS events and neither was campaign
  infrastructure. A DNS-only rule cannot see a modern browser redirect chain.
- Added domains observed at ARLP that are absent from the Trinity Cyber
  publication: traforbid.com, safedomainguard.org, sfdspons.safedomainguard.org.
  Infrastructure has rotated since the report, so the original list would have
  missed this delivery even with perfect DNS telemetry.
- The matches arm uses bare domains, giving subdomain coverage that the
  exact-match in() list cannot provide.
- Renamed. This is no longer a DNS-only rule.

False Positives:
Low. Domains and path patterns are campaign-specific infrastructure rather than
generic ad-tech parameters.

Response:
Investigate host, review network activity, block domains, and check for a payload
download in the same storyline.
*/

(event.type = "DNS" and #dns in (
"fyabyq.com",
"zutebo.com",
"jyagit.com",
"fajuez.com",
"hodeoc.com",
"gifowy.com",
"kiylox.com",
"idysuk.com",
"jyroda.com",
"iviqag.com",
"hyakio.com",
"cuyuzu.com",
"dislp.dropitsafe.online",
"cint.browsingit.online",
"cint.prvtbrws.online",
"cint.privitosurfo.online",
"cint.sfwtch.online",
"cint.ntgrdnw.online",
"cint.cablegaurdian.online",
"cint.mailingit.online",
"cint.sfml.online",
"results.streamio.site",
"chres.streamio.site",
"ffres.streamio.site",
"sder.collectitnow.net",
"sdcr.collectitnow.net",
"sdfr.collectitnow.net",
"eaed.collectitnow.net",
"each.collectitnow.net",
"eaff.collectitnow.net",
"traforbid.com",
"safedomainguard.org",
"sfdspons.safedomainguard.org"
)) or url.address matches '(?i)xfc/sfclick\?u=|jr\.php\?gz=|safedomainguard|traforbid|dropitsafe\.online|collectitnow\.net|streamio\.site|browsingit\.online|prvtbrws\.online|privitosurfo\.online|sfwtch\.online|ntgrdnw\.online|cablegaurdian\.online|mailingit\.online|sfml\.online'
